IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc3-interpretation`

-- ccc3-tests-interpretation.l4 -- tests of section 83.01. Every expected value is hand-written from the text, beside the assertion,
-- before the run; a failing assertion is a finding and its expectation is never edited to match the code.
-- Fixture names begin with the section label, like every top-level name of this part.

§ `Tests of section 83.01`

-- ---- "Canadian" (line 1254): a citizen, a permanent resident, or a body corporate incorporated and continued under the laws of Canada or a province.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) Canadian` `s 83.01(1) a Canadian citizen` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) Canadian` `s 83.01(1) a permanent resident within the meaning of subsection 2(1) of the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) Canadian` `s 83.01(1) a body corporate incorporated and continued under the laws of Canada or a province` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) Canadian` `s 83.01(1) none of those` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "means": a visitor who is not a permanent resident is not Canadian

-- ---- "entity" (line 1255): a person, group, trust, partnership or fund or an unincorporated association or organization.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) a person` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) a group` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) a trust` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) a partnership` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) a fund` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) an unincorporated association` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) an organization` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) entity` `s 83.01(1) none of those kinds of thing` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "means": a building is not an entity

-- ---- "listed entity" (line 1256): an entity on a list established by the Governor in Council under section 83.05.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) listed entity` `s 83.01(1) a group` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) listed entity` `s 83.01(1) a group` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- an entity not on the list
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) listed entity` `s 83.01(1) none of those kinds of thing` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- on the list, but not an entity

-- ---- paragraph (a) (lines 1258-1268): ten groups of offences, and a case that is none of them.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(i) unlawful seizure of aircraft (subsection 7(2); Hague Convention, 1970)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(ii) unlawful acts against the safety of civil aviation (subsection 7(2); Montreal Convention, 1971)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(iii) crimes against internationally protected persons (subsection 7(3); United Nations, 1973)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(iv) the taking of hostages (subsection 7(3.1); United Nations, 1979)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(v) nuclear material and nuclear terrorism (subsection 7(2.21); Vienna and New York, 1980, as amended 2005, and New York, 2005)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(vi) violence at airports (subsection 7(2); Montreal Protocol, 1988)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(vii) safety of maritime navigation (subsection 7(2.1); Rome Convention, 1988)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(viii) fixed platforms on the continental shelf (subsection 7(2.1) or (2.2); Rome Protocol, 1988)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(ix) terrorist bombings (subsection 7(3.72); United Nations, 1997)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a)(x) financing of terrorism (subsection 7(3.73); United Nations, 1999)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(a) the act or omission, if committed in Canada, is one of the listed offences` `s 83.01(1)(a) none of the offences listed in subparagraphs (i) to (x)` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- paragraph (b) (lines 1269-1278). Fixture: the ten facts in order: (i)(A) purpose, (i)(B) intention, (ii)(A) death or serious bodily harm,
-- (ii)(B) endangers a life, (ii)(C) serious risk to public health or safety, (ii)(D) substantial property damage, (ii)(D) that damage likely to result in (A) to (C),
-- (ii)(E) serious interference with an essential service, (ii)(E) as a result of advocacy, protest, dissent or stoppage of work, (ii)(E) that is not intended to result in (A) to (C).
GIVEN pa IS A BOOLEAN, ia IS A BOOLEAN, d1 IS A BOOLEAN, d2 IS A BOOLEAN, d3 IS A BOOLEAN, d4 IS A BOOLEAN, d5 IS A BOOLEAN, d6 IS A BOOLEAN, d7 IS A BOOLEAN, d8 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 83.01(1)(b) facts`
`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` MEANS `s 83.01(1)(b) facts` OF pa, ia, d1, d2, d3, d4, d5, d6, d7, d8

-- Expected from the text: both (i) limbs AND one of the (ii) limbs.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (ii)(A) alone
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (ii)(B) alone
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (ii)(C) alone
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (ii)(D): damage AND likely to result in (A) to (C)
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (ii)(D): damage but not likely to result in (A) to (C)
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (ii)(D): the likelihood without the damage
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (ii)(E): serious disruption, not as a result of advocacy
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (ii)(E): the carve-out applies (advocacy, not intended to result in (A) to (C))
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (ii)(E): from advocacy, but intended to result in (A) to (C): the carve-out does not apply
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- none of (ii)
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (i)(A) missing
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1)(b) the act or omission meets the purpose, intention and harm of paragraph (b)` (`s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- (i)(B) missing

-- ---- the exclusion (line 1279): armed conflict AND lawful under international law; OR military forces in their official duties AND governed by other rules of international law.
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 83.01(1) exclusion facts`
`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` MEANS `s 83.01(1) exclusion facts` OF a, b, c, d

#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the armed-conflict and military exclusion applies` (`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 83.01(1) the armed-conflict and military exclusion applies` (`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))   -- armed conflict, but not in accordance with international law
#ASSERT NOT (`s 83.01(1) the armed-conflict and military exclusion applies` (`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))   -- in accordance with international law, but no armed conflict
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the armed-conflict and military exclusion applies` (`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 83.01(1) the armed-conflict and military exclusion applies` (`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE))   -- military forces, but not governed by other rules of international law
#ASSERT NOT (`s 83.01(1) the armed-conflict and military exclusion applies` (`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))   -- governed by other rules, but not military forces in their official duties
#ASSERT NOT (`s 83.01(1) the armed-conflict and military exclusion applies` (`s 83.01(1) test exclusion` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))

-- ---- the whole definition (lines 1257-1279).
`s 83.01(1) no exclusion` MEANS `s 83.01(1) test exclusion` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`s 83.01(1) armed conflict exclusion` MEANS `s 83.01(1) test exclusion` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
`s 83.01(1) bombing facts` MEANS `s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`s 83.01(1) no (b) facts` MEANS `s 83.01(1)(b) test facts` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`s 83.01(1) listed offence of hostages` MEANS `s 83.01(1)(a)(iv) the taking of hostages (subsection 7(3.1); United Nations, 1979)`
`s 83.01(1) no listed offence` MEANS `s 83.01(1)(a) none of the offences listed in subparagraphs (i) to (x)`

#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) the act or omission itself` `s 83.01(1) listed offence of hostages` `s 83.01(1) no (b) facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "means (a)"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) the act or omission itself` `s 83.01(1) no listed offence` `s 83.01(1) bombing facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "means ... (b)"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) a conspiracy to commit the act or omission` `s 83.01(1) no listed offence` `s 83.01(1) bombing facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "includes a conspiracy"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) an attempt to commit the act or omission` `s 83.01(1) no listed offence` `s 83.01(1) bombing facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "attempt"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) a threat to commit the act or omission` `s 83.01(1) listed offence of hostages` `s 83.01(1) no (b) facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "threat"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) being an accessory after the fact in relation to the act or omission` `s 83.01(1) no listed offence` `s 83.01(1) bombing facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "accessory after the fact"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) counselling in relation to the act or omission` `s 83.01(1) no listed offence` `s 83.01(1) bombing facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "counselling"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) the act or omission itself` `s 83.01(1) no listed offence` `s 83.01(1) no (b) facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- neither (a) nor (b)
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) a conspiracy to commit the act or omission` `s 83.01(1) no listed offence` `s 83.01(1) no (b) facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a conspiracy to commit something that is not a terrorist activity
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) a form of conduct that is none of those` `s 83.01(1) listed offence of hostages` `s 83.01(1) bombing facts` `s 83.01(1) no exclusion` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a form the definition does not name (fork F-ccc3-2)
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the act or omission is a terrorist activity` `s 83.01(1) the act or omission itself` `s 83.01(1) listed offence of hostages` `s 83.01(1) bombing facts` `s 83.01(1) armed conflict exclusion` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- "does not include": the exclusion beats both (a) and (b)

-- ---- "terrorist group" (lines 1280-1283).
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the group is a terrorist group` `s 83.01(1) a group` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a): an entity whose purposes include facilitating or carrying out a terrorist activity
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the group is a terrorist group` `s 83.01(1) a group` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b): a listed entity
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the group is a terrorist group` `s 83.01(1) a group` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- "includes an association of such entities"
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the group is a terrorist group` `s 83.01(1) a group` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- an entity with no such purpose, not listed, not an association
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the group is a terrorist group` `s 83.01(1) none of those kinds of thing` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not an entity at all, though its purposes include it
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1) the group is a terrorist group` `s 83.01(1) none of those kinds of thing` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- on the list, but not an entity

-- ---- (1.1): the expression of a thought, belief or opinion does not come within (b) unless it satisfies (b)'s criteria.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.1) the expression of thought, belief or opinion comes within paragraph (b)` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.1) the expression of thought, belief or opinion comes within paragraph (b)` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the "unless" is met: paragraph (b) answers
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.1) the expression of thought, belief or opinion comes within paragraph (b)` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.1) the expression of thought, belief or opinion comes within paragraph (b)` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- not only an expression: paragraph (b) answers
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.1) the expression of thought, belief or opinion comes within paragraph (b)` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- (1.2): a suicide bombing is within (a) or (b) if it satisfies the criteria of that paragraph.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.2) a suicide bombing comes within paragraph (a) or (b)` FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not a suicide bombing: the subsection says nothing about it
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.2) a suicide bombing comes within paragraph (a) or (b)` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.2) a suicide bombing comes within paragraph (a) or (b)` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.2) a suicide bombing comes within paragraph (a) or (b)` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the "if" is not met
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.2) a suicide bombing comes within paragraph (a) or (b)` TRUE NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 83.01(1.2) a suicide bombing comes within paragraph (a) or (b)` TRUE NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- ---- (2): facilitation is construed as in subsection 83.19(2): the answer of that subsection, passed through.
#ASSERT `s 83.01(2) facilitation is construed in accordance with subsection 83.19(2)` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(2) facilitation is construed in accordance with subsection 83.19(2)` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 83.01(2) facilitation is construed in accordance with subsection 83.19(2)` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
